---
/*
  The handoff page. Build packet 6.5 and Part 5.4: one paragraph in Denvil's
  voice, one card for the current study, one button across to grabyourbibles.com.
  It NEVER lists sessions and NEVER republishes study content — every session
  lives at exactly one URL, on the study site. Canonical stays there.
*/
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Signup from '../components/Signup.astro';
import UnderConstruction from '../components/UnderConstruction.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';

const STUDY_SITE = 'https://grabyourbibles.com';
---
<Base
  title={`Studies — ${site.name}`}
  description="Guided Bible studies you can walk through on your own or with a group."
>
  <section class="band shell">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h1>Studies</h1>
      <span class="label">grabyourbibles.com</span>
    </div>

    <p class="art-dek" style="margin-bottom:1.4rem">
      The studies live on their own site, because they are a different kind of thing than
      an essay. An essay is me working an idea out in writing. A study is you with your
      Bible open, marking the text yourself, on your own or with a room full of people.
    </p>

    <div class="studies-card reveal" style="margin-bottom:2rem">
      <div class="studies-body">
        <span class="pill">How it works</span>
        <h2>You read it. You mark it. You say what you noticed.</h2>
        <p class="dek">
          Underline what God is doing or saying. Circle a word that repeats, or one you do
          not understand. Highlight whatever gets your attention, even if you cannot say
          why. Then say it out loud. If you know why it stood out, say so. If you do not,
          &ldquo;it just stood out&rdquo; is a complete answer.
        </p>
        <p class="studies-note"><b>Pay attention to what gets your attention.</b></p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={STUDY_SITE} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Go to the studies <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="studies-aside" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="studies-mark">Grab<br />Your<br />Bibles</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <UnderConstruction
      line="The first study &mdash; <b>seven sessions in Ruth</b> &mdash; is being set now. Leave your email and I will let you know the moment it opens."
    />
  </section>
  <Signup />
</Base>
